<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for export of a 100-pound (45.36 kilo) sacks of ecuadorean coffee, effective from November 28 to December 4 the 1996.</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 104.46</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$  99.80</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  57.46</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$  93.57</p>
</text>
